        },
        {
          "text": "Te ma matu ’ba emi vu, ma adripi, Opi amani Yesu Kristonisi azini ale Orindinisi, emi ma ’di a’di lokporu ma dri ziza emini Mungu vurisi, ",
          "type": "text",
